{"articleNo":"539225","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=539225&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] 2025년 하반기 연구활동종사자 안전교육 수강 안내","writer":"시설안전과","writeDate":"2025.10.14","hit":"5638","attachments":[{"name":"연구실 안전교육 온라인 수강 방법 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=539225&attachNo=158024"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">○ 교육대상 : 교직원 및 대학원생, 학부생(※ 2025.09.01.이후 임용ㆍ입학 시 신규교육 대상으로 집합교육)</span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\">&nbsp; - 과학기술개발 분야 학과 및 연구실 소속(교수, 조교, 연구원, 대학원, 학부연구생)</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\">&nbsp; - 실험, 실습수업(컴퓨터 실습 포함)을 하나 이상 수강하는 학부생</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\">&nbsp; ※ 교육대상이 아니더라도 전체 학부생은 교육이수 가능<b><span style=\"outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(58, 50, 195);\">(비교과 마일리지 60점 지급)</span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">○ 교육기간 : 2025. 9. 1. ~ 2025. 12. 31.</span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">○ 교육시간 : 6시간</span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\">○ 교육방법 (※ 자세한 이용방법은 첨부파일 참조)</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\">&nbsp; - 연구실 안전관리 시스템(labsafety.kumoh.ac.kr)을 통한 온라인 교육 (권장)</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\">&nbsp; - <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><u><b>모바일(msafety.kumoh.ac.kr)로도 수강할 수 있으나, 오류가 많아 PC교육 권장</b></u></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; =&gt; 연구실안전관리시스템(PC):&nbsp; l</span></b></span><b style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">absafety.kumoh.ac.kr&nbsp;</span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\">○ 교육이수 : 진도율 100% + 평가(60점 이상)</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\">&nbsp;※ 평가를 완료하여야 교육이수 처리됨&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: break-all; border: 0px;\">○ 관련근거</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); word-break: bre